.SH "نام (NAME)"
plasmoidviewer \- Run Plasma widgets in their own window
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBplasmoidviewer\fR\ 'u
\fBplasmoidviewer\fR [\fB\-v, \-\-version\fR] [\fB\-c, \-\-containment\fR\fIname\fR] [\fB\-a, \-\-applet\fR\fIname\fR] [\fB\-f, \-\-formfactor\fR\fIname\fR] [\fB\-l, \-\-location\fR\fIname\fR] [\fB\-x, \-\-xPosition\fR\fIxPosition\fR] [\fB\-y, \-\-yPosition\fR\fIyPosition\fR] [\fB\-s, \-\-size\fR\fIwidthXheight\fR] [\fB\-p, \-\-pixmapcache\fR\fIsize\fR] [\fB\-t, \-\-theme\fR\fIname\fR] [\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR] [args]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBplasmoidviewer\fR
is a graphical tool allowing developers to test Plasma applets\&.
.PP
Only installed applets will be found\&.
\fBkbuildsycoca5\fR
may need to be run for newly\-installed applets to be found\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-v, \-\-version\fR
.RS 4
Displays version information\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-c, \-\-containment \fR\fB\fIname\fR\fR
.RS 4
The name of the containment plugin\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-a, \-\-applet \fR\fB\fIname\fR\fR
.RS 4
The name of the applet plugin\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-f, \-\-formfactor \fR\fB\fIname\fR\fR
.RS 4
The formfactor to use (horizontal, vertical, mediacenter, planar or application)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-l, \-\-location \fR\fB\fIname\fR\fR
.RS 4
The location constraint to start the Containment with (floating, desktop, fullscreen, topedge, bottomedge, leftedge, rightedge)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-x, \-\-xPosition \fR\fB\fIxPosition\fR\fR
.RS 4
Set the x position of the plasmoidviewer on the Plasma desktop\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-y, \-\-yPosition \fR\fB\fIyPosition\fR\fR
.RS 4
Set the y position of the plasmoidviewer on the Plasma desktop\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-s, \-\-size \fR\fB\fIwidthXheight\fR\fR
.RS 4
Set the window size of the plasmoidview\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-p, \-\-pixmapcache \fR\fB\fIsize\fR\fR
.RS 4
The size in KB to set the pixmap cache to\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-t, \-\-theme \fR\fB\fIname\fR\fR
.RS 4
The name of the theme which the shell will use\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Displays this help\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\fIargs\fR\fR
.RS 4
Data that should be passed to the applet as \*(AqexternalData\*(Aq event\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
More detailed user documentation is available from
\m[blue]\fBhelp:/plasma\-desktop\fR\m[]
(either enter this
URL
into
Konqueror, or run
\fB\fBkhelpcenter\fR\fR\fB \fR\fB\fIhelp:/plasma\-desktop\fR\fR)\&.
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
\fBplasmoidviewer\fR
was written by
Aaron Seigo
<aseigo@kde\&.org>\&.
